// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:35:3: proved: the precondition of 'bump[succ@lambda_named.pia:35:10]' holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:34:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:40:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:44:3: proved: the precondition of 'bump[same@lambda_named.pia:44:10]' holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:12:5: proved: the loop invariant holds on entry [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:13:11: proved: the index is within bounds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:13:30: proved: '+' does not overflow usize [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:12:5: proved: the loop invariant holds after each iteration [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:9:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:35:10: proved: the precondition of 'succ' holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:35:10: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:25:3: proved: the precondition of 'succ@lambda_named.pia:35:10' holds [smt]
// CHECK: lambda_named.pia:24:3: proved: the postcondition holds [smt]
